+    ) -> float:
+        """
+        Calculates exact mathematical break-even win rate after accounting for friction in R:
+        E[net R] = p * (k_tp / k_sl) - (1 - p) * 1.0 - friction_r = 0
+        => p * (k_tp/k_sl + 1) = 1.0 + friction_r
